---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="SmartUtilBox | inflation">
    <div class="px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-8">

            <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">

                <div class="mb-8 text-center">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4" data-i18n="inf-h1">你的存款正在縮水嗎？</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" data-i18n="inf-desc">計算通貨膨脹如何無聲無息地吃掉你的財富。了解未來的實質購買力，儘早為您的資產配置建立抗通膨護城河。</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Calculator Layout -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">

                    <!-- Inputs Column -->
                    <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
                        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2" data-i18n="inf-input-title">試算條件</h3>

                            <form id="inflation-form" class="space-y-5">
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1" data-i18n="inf-label-cash">目前現金存款</label>
                                    <input type="text" id="inf-cash" inputmode="numeric" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-200 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 shadow-sm font-bold text-lg text-right" value="1,000,000">
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1" data-i18n="inf-label-rate">預估年通膨率 (%)</label>
                                    <input type="number" id="inf-rate" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-200 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 shadow-sm font-bold text-lg text-right" value="3.0" min="0" step="0.1">
                                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2 flex items-start leading-relaxed">
                                        <span class="mr-1">💡</span>
                                        <span><strong>參考值：</strong>歐美主要央行長期通膨目標為 <strong>2%</strong>；台灣歷史長期平均約落在 <strong>1.5% - 2%</strong>。若欲保守推演未來的實質購買力流失，建議填寫 <strong>2.5% - 3%</strong>。</span>
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1" data-i18n="inf-label-years">預估時間 (年)</label>
                                    <input type="number" id="inf-years" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-200 text-slate-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-400 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 shadow-sm font-bold text-lg text-right" value="10" min="1" max="50">
                                </div>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Results Column -->
                    <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
                        <!-- Chart Container -->
                        <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-full">

                            <!-- Big Result Text -->
                            <div class="text-center mb-8 w-full bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                                <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-2" id="result-headline">經過 10 年後，您的 1,000,000 實質購買力將只剩下：</p>
                                <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-700 tracking-tight" id="result-amount">744,093</p>
                                <p class="text-sm text-red-500 mt-3 font-medium bg-red-50 inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-red-100" id="result-loss">🔻 蒸發價值：255,907</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="relative h-64 sm:h-80 w-full">
                                <canvas id="inflationChart"></canvas>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Business Logic Banner (Lead Generation) -->
                <div class="mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900" data-i18n="inf-cta-title">別讓通膨吃掉你的辛勞</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-i18n="inf-cta-desc">現金是抗通膨能力最差的資產。立刻使用投資組合 X-Ray，或預約專業顧問，建立抗通膨的實體資產護城河。</p>
                    <a href="/portfolio-roi" class="inline-block bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full transition-transform transform hover:scale-105 shadow-md text-lg">
                        <span data-i18n="inf-cta-btn">前往投資組合 X-Ray</span>
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- SEO & FAQ Section -->
            <div class="mt-12 bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 mb-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-3">如何對抗通膨：保護您的實質購買力</h2>

                <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-sans">
                    <p>通貨膨脹 (Inflation) 是財富的隱形殺手。即使您的銀行存款帳面數字沒有減少，但隨著物價上漲，您能買到的商品與服務卻越來越少。理解並對抗通膨，是長期財務規劃中最重要的一環。</p>

                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mt-4">什麼是「實質購買力」？</h3>
                    <p>名目財富 (Nominal Wealth) 只是您擁有的貨幣數量，而實質購買力 (Purchasing Power) 才是您真正擁有的生活品質。當通膨率為 3% 時，您藏在保險箱裡的 100 萬元，十年後的購買力將等同於現在的 74 萬。這意味著您的購買力「蒸發」了四分之一。</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
                        <li><strong>現金是最差的長期資產：</strong> 存放現金等於確定會以每年通膨率的速度貶值。</li>
                        <li><strong>固定收益的迷思：</strong> 若定存利率低於通膨率，您的實質報酬率其實是負的。</li>
                        <li><strong>時間效應：</strong> 通膨和複利一樣具有指數效應，時間拉長，殺傷力驚人。</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mt-4">利用實體資產抗通膨的策略</h3>
                    <p>為了維持甚至提升實質購買力，我們必須將資金配置到具有「抗通膨 (Inflation Hedge)」特性的資產上。這類資產的價格與收益通常會跟著物價指數水漲船高。</p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
                        <li><strong>房地產與 REITs：</strong> 實體房地產的價值與租金收入通常能與通膨同步上升，是歷史上最穩健的抗通膨工具之一。</li>
                        <li><strong>優質股票：</strong> 具有定價權的企業，能將成本上漲轉嫁給消費者，進而維持利潤與股息成長。</li>
                        <li><strong>原物料與黃金：</strong> 在惡性通膨時期，實體大宗商品往往具有保值甚至增值的功能。</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Needs Submission Block -->
        <section class="bg-white py-10 border-t border-slate-200 flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900" data-i18n="footer-cta-title">對理財有疑問？留下一句話，讓我們開始對話。</h2>
                <form action="/contact" method="GET" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                    <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="您的 Email" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-900 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-slate-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-400 w-full sm:w-auto flex-1 shadow-sm" required>
                    <button type="submit" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-md transition duration-300 w-full sm:w-auto shadow-md" data-i18n="footer-cta-btn">
                        開始諮詢
                    </button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer inside main content -->
        <footer class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 py-6 flex-shrink-0 border-t border-slate-200">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center text-sm max-w-5xl">
                <div class="text-center sm:text-left mb-4 sm:mb-0">
                    <p>&copy; 2026 SmartUtilBox. All rights reserved.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-x-4">
                    <a href="/privacy-policy.html" class="hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors" data-i18n="footer-privacy">隱私權政策</a>
                        <a href="/terms.html" class="hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors" data-i18n="footer-terms">服務條款</a>
                    <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors" data-i18n="footer-guide">理財專欄</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </footer>

    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>

        /* --- Sidebar Logic --- */
        const sidebar = document.getElementById('sidebar');
        const openSidebarBtn = document.getElementById('open-sidebar');
        const closeSidebarBtn = document.getElementById('close-sidebar');
        const sidebarOverlay = document.getElementById('sidebar-overlay');

        function openSidebar() {
            sidebar.classList.remove('-translate-x-full');
            sidebarOverlay.classList.remove('hidden');
        }

        function closeSidebar() {
            sidebar.classList.add('-translate-x-full');
            sidebarOverlay.classList.add('hidden');
        }

        openSidebarBtn.addEventListener('click', openSidebar);
        closeSidebarBtn.addEventListener('click', closeSidebar);
        sidebarOverlay.addEventListener('click', closeSidebar);

        /* --- i18n Dictionary --- */
        const i18n = {
            'zh-tw': {
                'title-inflation': '通膨與實質購買力計算機 | 你的存款正在縮水嗎？',
                'inf-h1': '你的存款正在縮水嗎？',
                'inf-desc': '計算通貨膨脹如何無聲無息地吃掉你的財富。了解未來的實質購買力，儘早為您的資產配置建立抗通膨護城河。',
                'inf-input-title': '試算條件',
                'inf-label-cash': '目前現金存款',
                'inf-label-rate': '預估年通膨率 (%)',
                'inf-label-years': '預估時間 (年)',

                'inf-result-headline': '經過 [Y] 年後，您的 [AMT] 實質購買力將只剩下：',
                'inf-result-loss': '🔻 蒸發價值：[LOSS]',

                'inf-cta-title': '別讓通膨吃掉你的辛勞',
                'inf-cta-desc': '現金是抗通膨能力最差的資產。立刻使用投資組合 X-Ray，或預約專業顧問，建立抗通膨的實體資產護城河。',
                'inf-cta-btn': '前往投資組合 X-Ray',

                },
            'en': {
                'title-inflation': 'Inflation & Purchasing Power Calculator | Are Your Savings Shrinking?',
                'inf-h1': 'Are Your Savings Shrinking?',
                'inf-desc': 'Calculate how inflation silently erodes your wealth. Understand your future purchasing power and build an inflation-resistant moat for your asset allocation early on.',
                'inf-input-title': 'Calculation Details',
                'inf-label-cash': 'Current Cash Savings',
                'inf-label-rate': 'Expected Annual Inflation (%)',
                'inf-label-years': 'Time Horizon (Years)',

                'inf-result-headline': 'In [Y] years, your [AMT] will have the purchasing power of only:',
                'inf-result-loss': '🔻 Value Evaporated: [LOSS]',

                'inf-cta-title': 'Don\'t Let Inflation Eat Your Hard Work',
                'inf-cta-desc': 'Cash is the worst asset for fighting inflation. Use our Portfolio X-Ray immediately, or book an expert advisor to build a moat of real assets against inflation.',
                'inf-cta-btn': 'Go to Portfolio X-Ray',

                }
        };

        // --- Utilities ---
        function getLang() {
            const selector = document.getElementById('language-selector');
            return selector ? selector.value : 'zh-tw';
        }

        function t(key) {
            return i18n[getLang()][key] !== undefined ? i18n[getLang()][key] : key;
        }

        function formatNumberWithCommas(value) {
            const num = value.toString().replace(/\D/g, "");
            return num.replace(/\B(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))/g, ",");
        }

        function formatCurrency(value) {
            return new Intl.NumberFormat(undefined, { maximumFractionDigits: 0 }).format(value);
        }

        function parseNum(val) {
            if (!val) return 0;
            return parseFloat(val.toString().replace(/,/g, '')) || 0;
        }

        // --- App Logic ---
        let myChart = null;

        function calculateInflation() {
            const cashInput = document.getElementById('inf-cash').value;
            const rateInput = document.getElementById('inf-rate').value;
            const yearsInput = document.getElementById('inf-years').value;

            const initialCash = parseNum(cashInput);
            const inflationRate = parseFloat(rateInput) / 100;
            const years = parseInt(yearsInput);

            if (isNaN(initialCash) || isNaN(inflationRate) || isNaN(years) || years <= 0) return;

            const labels = [];
            const dataValues = [];

            let currentPower = initialCash;
            labels.push('0');
            dataValues.push(currentPower);

            for (let i = 1; i <= years; i++) {
                currentPower = currentPower / (1 + inflationRate);
                labels.push(i.toString());
                dataValues.push(currentPower);
            }

            const finalPower = dataValues[years];
            const loss = initialCash - finalPower;

            // Update UI Text
            const headlineTemplate = t('inf-result-headline');
            const headline = headlineTemplate.replace('[Y]', years).replace('[AMT]', formatCurrency(initialCash));
            document.getElementById('result-headline').textContent = headline;

            document.getElementById('result-amount').textContent = formatCurrency(finalPower);

            const lossTemplate = t('inf-result-loss');
            document.getElementById('result-loss').textContent = lossTemplate.replace('[LOSS]', formatCurrency(loss));

            // Update Chart
            updateChart(labels, dataValues, initialCash);
        }

        function updateChart(labels, dataValues, initialCash) {
            const ctx = document.getElementById('inflationChart').getContext('2d');

            if (myChart) {
                myChart.destroy();
            }

            Chart.defaults.color = '#64748b'; /* slate-50 */0
            Chart.defaults.font.family = '"Inter", "Noto Sans TC", sans-serif';

            myChart = new Chart(ctx, {
                type: 'line',
                data: {
                    labels: labels,
                    datasets: [{
                        label: getLang() === 'en' ? 'Purchasing Power' : '實質購買力',
                        data: dataValues,
                        borderColor: '#ef4444', // red-500
                        backgroundColor: 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1)',
                        borderWidth: 3,
                        pointBackgroundColor: '#ef4444',
                        pointBorderColor: '#ffffff',
                        pointRadius: 4,
                        pointHoverRadius: 6,
                        fill: true,
                        tension: 0.3
                    }]
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    plugins: {
                        legend: {
                            display: false
                        },
                        tooltip: {
                            backgroundColor: '#1e293b', /* slate-800 */
                            titleColor: '#f8fafc', /* slate-50 */
                            bodyColor: '#cbd5e1', /* slate-300 */
                            borderColor: '#334155', /* slate-700 */
                            borderWidth: 1,
                            callbacks: {
                                label: function(context) {
                                    return formatCurrency(context.parsed.y);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    scales: {
                        y: {
                            beginAtZero: true,
                            suggestedMax: initialCash,
                            grid: {
                                color: '#f1f5f9', // slate-100
                            },
                            ticks: {
                                callback: function(value) {
                                    if(value >= 1000000) return (value/1000000).toFixed(1) + 'M';
                                    if(value >= 1000) return (value/1000).toFixed(0) + 'K';
                                    return value;
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        x: {
                            grid: {
                                display: false
                            },
                            title: {
                                display: true,
                                text: getLang() === 'en' ? 'Years' : '年份'
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            });
        }

        function updateTranslations() {
            document.querySelectorAll('[data-i18n]').forEach(el => {
                const key = el.getAttribute('data-i18n');
                const lang = getLang();
                if (i18n[lang] && i18n[lang][key] !== undefined) {
                    if (el.tagName === 'INPUT' && el.type === 'button') {
                        el.value = i18n[lang][key];
                    } else if (el.tagName === 'DIV' || el.tagName === 'P' || el.tagName === 'H2' || el.tagName === 'H3' || el.tagName === 'LABEL' || el.tagName === 'SPAN' || el.tagName === 'A' || el.tagName === 'TH') {
                        if (el.children.length === 0) {
                             el.textContent = i18n[lang][key];
                        } else {
                             el.innerHTML = i18n[lang][key];
                        }
                    } else {
                        el.textContent = i18n[lang][key];
                    }
                }
            });

            document.title = t('title-inflation');
            document.getElementById('header-title').textContent = t('title-inflation').split(' | ')[0];

            calculateInflation();
        }

        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const langSelector = document.getElementById('language-selector');
            if (langSelector) {
                const savedLang = localStorage.getItem('calc-lang');
                if (savedLang && (savedLang === 'zh-tw' || savedLang === 'en')) {
                    langSelector.value = savedLang;
                }

                langSelector.addEventListener('change', (e) => {
                    localStorage.setItem('calc-lang', e.target.value);
                    updateTranslations();
                });
            }

            const cashInput = document.getElementById('inf-cash');
            cashInput.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
                let cursorPosition = e.target.selectionStart;
                let originalLength = e.target.value.length;
                e.target.value = formatNumberWithCommas(e.target.value);
                let newLength = e.target.value.length;
                cursorPosition = cursorPosition + (newLength - originalLength);
                e.target.setSelectionRange(cursorPosition, cursorPosition);
                calculateInflation();
            });

            document.getElementById('inf-rate').addEventListener('input', calculateInflation);
            document.getElementById('inf-years').addEventListener('input', calculateInflation);

            updateTranslations();
        });

</script>
